        "original_id": "afdd3f8e-e868-5146-8c1e-ac0cd45427c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, Brian Fee, Kiel Murray, Bob Peterson, Mike Rich, Fiona Victory\n- Works: Return to Oz, Cars 3, Dear Rosie, Swept from the Sea\n- Roles: director, writer, producer, actor, editor, sound designer, novelist, agent\n\nFacts:\n- Return to Oz is a 1985 fantasy adventure film directed and written by Walter Murch, co-written by Gill Dennis, and produced by Paul Maslansky.\n- Walter Murch is an editor and sound designer.\n- Fiona Victory appeared in the 1985 film Return to Oz.\n- Fiona Victory appeared in the 1997 film Swept from the Sea.\n- Cars 3 was directed by Brian Fee, and its screenplay was written by Kiel Murray, Bob Peterson, and Mike Rich.\n- Dear Rosie follows Rosie, played by Fiona Victory, an unsuccessful novelist who begins receiving letters from overweight people after her agent publishes her diet tips.",
